{"lines":[{"w":0.058270676930745502,"t":"Test 2","y":0.056664520095130566,"h":0.017463386864794206,"c":1,"x":0.79699248066056716},{"w":0.6484962463378906,"t":"There are a wide range of neurological diseases and conditions that can affect episodic","h":0.01745683518978991,"c":1,"x":0.073308268323991538,"y":0.10463618816812648},{"c":1,"x":0.073308282992686741,"y":0.12063953458077292,"t":"memory. These range from Alzheimer's to schizophrenia to autism. An impairment of episodic","w":0.69360900878906251,"h":0.017480233678185186},{"y":0.13659248011562086,"x":0.073242245760578112,"c":1,"t":"memory can have a profound effect on individuals' lives. For example, the symptoms of","w":0.64864547729492195,"h":0.019326566805474177},{"x":0.073308280270881224,"y":0.15260785599101312,"t":"schizophrenia can be reasonably well controlled by medication; however, patients' episodic","w":0.67481201171875005,"h":0.016097875080489321,"c":1},{"t":"memory may still be impaired and so they are often unable to return to university or work.","x":0.073308276797789965,"y":0.16860465088204579,"h":0.015988372635703185,"c":1,"w":0.65977442423502608},{"x":0.073250771057244174,"w":0.68807337443033856,"c":1,"h":0.017713541840247982,"t":"Recent studies have shown that computer-assisted games designed to keep the brain active","y":0.18402170697202158},{"h":0.013081395234588844,"x":0.073308271993539897,"c":1,"t":"can help improve their episodic memory.","y":0.20203488377157852,"w":0.3007518768310547},{"c":1,"x":0.073308266996149216,"y":0.22376046357702672,"h":0.014611629233080903,"w":0.65789474487304689,"t":"Episodic memories can help people connect with others, for instance by sharing intimate"},{"y":0.23824855089142072,"h":0.016111913682258505,"w":0.65977442423502608,"c":1,"x":0.073308281796960514,"t":"details about their past: something individuals with autism often have problems with. This"},{"x":0.073308263375384403,"w":0.68609024047851563,"h":0.016097875080489432,"c":1,"t":"may be caused by an absence of a sense of self. This is essential for the storage of episodic","y":0.25434642623492865},{"t":"memory, and has been found to be impaired in children with autism. Research has shown","c":1,"y":0.26996373472584723,"w":0.66362380981445312,"h":0.01653392347150362,"x":0.073259876939038404},{"w":0.6637213643391926,"h":0.019331979352431472,"t":"that treatments that improve memory may also have a positive impact on children's social","x":0.07321778018473088,"c":1,"y":0.28437973388954174},{"h":0.015378705164116546,"y":0.30335715903265581,"t":"development.","c":1,"x":0.07320977478839831,"w":0.10170075098673502},{"t":"One study looked at a...","x":0.073308269463260842,"w":0.18609022776285805,"y":0.32703488391178059,"h":0.014562025272838564,"c":1},{"y":0.22093023282821034,"w":0.037593984603881747,"c":1,"x":0.77443609037064964,"h":0.015988371407532842,"t":"Q40"},{"t":"107","w":0.033834587732950783,"c":1,"y":0.94476744187911454,"x":0.81766917219942481,"h":0.013081395234588844}],"w":2400,"h":3106}